Subject: [PATCH] DOM: test that runs of sibling comments and text are parsed,
 appended and removed in linear time (Sunset P1)

Time from n to 4n: about 4 when linear, 16 when quadratic. Each fails
before the change that follows (16.9, 17.2, 16.2 and 15.5): 40,000
sibling comments took 1.4 s to parse, 1.1 s to append by script and
1.4 s to remove one by one.

